      en: ["Kováčová was first documented in written records in 1254.", "The thermal water springs have a natural temperature of 48.5°C.", "The town hosts the National Rehabilitation Center, opened in 1987.", "It is located in the Zvolen District within the Banská Bystrica Region.", "The population of the municipality is around 1,600 people.", "The thermal springs were discovered accidentally during geological drilling."],
      es: ["Habitantes: aprox. 1.200", "Primera mención: 1255", "Baño termal: agua alcalina", "Iglesia: barroca, siglo XVIII", "Río: Hron", "Cerca de: Pustý hrad (ruinas del castillo)"],
      pt: ["Habitantes: aprox. 1.200", "Primeira menção: 1255", "Termas: água alcalina", "Igreja: barroca, século XVIII", "Rio: Hron", "Perto de: Pustý hrad (ruínas do castelo)"],
